      <activity id="376c06f4-bc6c-5a56-9eef-46e40442b873" activityNameId="69311a68-879d-5f62-b6cd-0483afa64ef2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roundwood, meranti (SFM), under bark, u=70%, at forest road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundwood, meranti (SFM), under bark, u=70%, at forest road
dataset represents well-documented, legally operating logging company with modern equipment;
Synonyms: Shorea ssp., Seraya, Lauan; 
UUID: e7cf2588-53f9-3aac-b84c-32cd10beb2e9
includes harvesting and  hauling operations as well as fuel used for forest road construction, including burning of branchings; land use of forest roads and gravel are distregarded; branchings are left to rot on the ground. logging impacts on further vegetation and environmental impacts from post-harvest processes (potential forest degradation/deforestation) are not covered.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average technology; forest operations largely based on manual labor. fuel consumption is interpolated by Collins et al 2002 assumed to lie between azobe dataset and European average consumption
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature, partly relying on estimates (fuel consumption) 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e7cf2588-53f9-3aac-b84c-32cd10beb2e9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
